{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_04",
  "title": "Triathlon",
  "storyCode": "DH-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "72d093ce8b18b6351b7b071cd136cd067053f7e789c39433c2db477c16cf6bf8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They've been the target of collusion from the very start of the event, but LUNG wRATh have once again put on a marvelous breakthrough act."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mr. Pancho, you mentioned how this team was struggling to mesh in Round 1. What do you think of them now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cooperation troubles don't get resolved in one night."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But obviously, these two know about the problem, so they've clearly divided up their combat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This time, it's a lot more nimble than the fighting in Round 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good to know. So, does that mean their chance of victory has shot up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Still hard to say. The other contestants'll have their own countermeasures."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's true. Trying to hold back LUNG wRATh normally has already proven ineffective, so let's hope the other competitors can show us some new tricks!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh, they're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And the mood between them's eased a bit too. Wonder if anything happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So it comes from the Iberian period, no wonder..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm? Missy, that's not the competition. What are you looking at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Information on this cruise ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's so interesting? Did you just say Iberia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah. The ship's actually a relic from the age of Iberia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That early...? Actually, thinking about it, there's no other country that would have stuff like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mhm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And Mayor Candela paid big money to buy it off the Iberians, and for the tech to remodel it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And all this just to have the thing floating out on the city's sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't think there's another person across the whole world who'd do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That sure is some level of luxury."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Speaking of which, Missy, weren't you looking into this Mayor the past two days? Any findings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Findings... they're still pretty basic so far."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This Candela Sanchez, in some sense, is someone who can stand shoulder to shoulder with Chief Wei."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's that powerful?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah. It's not exactly the same, but they're both completely wrapped up in their cities, and both have a tight grip on the reins of government."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As a member of the L.G.D., I would absolutely never say I admire someone who builds a city like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But as a daughter of the Schwire family, I have to admit, a builder like that is a real tough customer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If we're saying this city's base is much more solid than it seems, then its superstructure is even crazier than it seems."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Agents of three governments come flooding into this city every day, and the news will sometimes report on disputes, even small-scale conflicts, between them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the thing is, nobody cares."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They come here as an open secret, respect an unwritten code of conduct, and revel in a joy they could never have outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can you picture it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The first time the three sides clashed, Mayor Candela showed up for sure, and used some method we could never imagine to 'talk them over.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And after that, anyone who came to this city had to keep by the rules she set."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I just don't know what it was. Leverage? Or a political bargaining chip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lady Candela has enough armed force on hand to defend this city, that's for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But beyond all of that, I feel like there's a real simple answer, Missy. Haven't you already realized?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Realized what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here's what it is—alcohol, sugar, coffee, and entertainment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How could those things possibly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's a time-old tale, Missy. The frugal convert to extravagance, but it's a nightmare to go the other way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forget old boys who've been spoiled rotten since childhood. You could even take me. If I suddenly lost something I was real used to and felt was real nice, I'd be struggling for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not to mention after losing it, I'd have to make do with junk instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sometimes, people's wills just bend like paper, and what Bolívar's like now really doesn't help. If you told me this place was full of people with firm wills, I wouldn't believe you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It can't have been that smooth as first, but as time went on, nobody could stand up to reject it all. All of this has become some sort of status quo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I'll also acknowledge, for being able to decide straight from the start that this was how this city would come to manifest, this Mayor really is phenomenally powerful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Powerful to the point that it's frightening."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's a curve ahead. Do we take a shortcut?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No need. According to the map, we get the most shortcuts on the cycling section. If someone's going to try something, it'll probably be around then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't forget, Ms. Candela has her underlings guarding the shortcuts. They're probably more dangerous than any dangerous terrorists."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If the other side didn't make a move during Round 1, I can only assume they'll be even more cautious during Round 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm. We'll see as things come."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come to mention it, Missy, does this MC seem familiar to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm? Now that you say it, it's like I really have seen them somewhere before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mmm. I feel like I've seen her somewhere, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sideroca",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's D.D.D., you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "D.D.D.? Oh, now I remember. She's that real famous DJ, right? I saw a poster once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's she doing here as a presenter, huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm? Wait... Sideroca? What are you doing here? Out on a mission?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sideroca",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You could say that. It was a mission in Bolívar, helping Eyjafjalla with some geological research on the side. We heard there was a city here, and once we were all done, we put in for a vacation here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sideroca",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How about you? Came with Ch'en?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, we came for a different reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You seem pretty in the know. You a music girl too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sideroca",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not really. A lot of operators are into her, and I've learned some things by osmosis. Right, you want to come over and sit with us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you say, Missy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright. I was getting a little bored of the competition anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eyjafjalla's here too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sideroca",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yep. She's out here so we can get her to relax for once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow, then that's perfect—I've never met her before. I intend to give her a proper hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
